The vhost-user description names the daemon's path: this tree installs it as
/usr/lib/virtiofsd (no /usr/libexec), so point the description there.
From Chimera Linux's main/virtiofsd (cports, BSD-2-Clause), rebased onto 1.14.0.

--- a/50-virtiofsd.json
+++ b/50-virtiofsd.json
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 {
   "description": "virtiofsd vhost-user-fs",
   "type": "fs",
-  "binary": "/usr/libexec/virtiofsd",
+  "binary": "/usr/lib/virtiofsd",
   "features": [
       "migrate-precopy",
       "posix-acl-negotiation-mode",
